haltiq_tau_hotpot/scoring.py adapts the official HotpotQA v1 evaluator:
https://github.com/hotpotqa/hotpot/blob/fa3a36370899e1d85822de61e58c85ea19993154/hotpot_evaluate_v1.py
Original file SHA256:
d35fc91a6db21d791dbdda11daf3856e9359f5701d54e3eefba20d88fecc02c0

Changes: standard-library imports, an in-memory single-question interface,
explicit zero metrics for an absent submission, and typed result dictionaries.
Answer normalization, answer/supporting-fact metrics and the joint
precision/recall construction retain the official definitions.

This custom HotpotQA environment uses Tau2 orchestration. Its scores are not
official released Tau2 benchmark scores, and this adaptation does not imply
endorsement by the HotpotQA authors.
